<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The conclave was structured over the course of two days, with various panels being formed to look at the problem statement from different angles and give their inputs. The vision consisted of a Qualitative and a Quantitative component, where the Qualitative Vision served as the intellectual and cultural foundation, offering conceptual clarity about the desired outcomes, and the Quantitative Vision being the actionable outcomes distributed as the roadmap for the future. The focus was to ground the vision into concrete, continually adaptable action points while keeping its inspirational and aspirational aspects intact. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
