/P 151 0 R
/Pg 13 0 R
>>
endobj
234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In that backdrop, the IKS Division, CoE under Ministry of Education, Government of Bharat and DES Pune University \(DES PU\), in collaboration with Prajna Pravah, organized a two-day Strategic Conclave for Indian Knowledge Systems \(IKS\) from December 14th to 15th, 2023, at the DES PU campus. This conclave aimed at crafting a National Vision for IKS, aligned with the National Education Policy 2020, to mainstream Indian epistemology and pedagogy as a legitimate alternative to Western thought models. The vision was structured around time specific milestones, with the long term vision guiding the shorter-term goals, and the action plan serving as a roadmap to implement and measure impact. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (     Vision)
/E (     Vision)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With a long term goal of reinstating IKS in India, the vision formulated through the conclave was: )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 644 0 R
/ActualText (Rectify the aberration and discontinuation of IKS forced under the Macaulite system of education. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 645 0 R
/ActualText (Seamlessly amalgamate the laukika \(folk\) and shastrika \(textual\) traditions into the education curriculum of learners across age groups. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 646 0 R
/ActualText (Utilize IKS to solve challenges facing the world today, including but not limited to environmental, developmental, social, political and cultural. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
240 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 647 0 R
/ActualText (Integrating IKS into the microcosm of individual lives and the macrocosm of national identity, fostering conceptual clarity and actionable outcomes. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 648 0 R
/ActualText (Develop a new public culture of knowledge led by academia.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
